<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>I'M A METALHEAD, BITCH!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">KILL KARL</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">I'M A METALHEAD, BITCH!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">38ENlrQMSdDpCBZq7T6xcH</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.090" end="00:02.940">Da-da-da-da-da-da, da-da-da-da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.940" end="00:05.290">"What the fuck?" That's what everybody says</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.290" end="00:08.270">When they find out I grind out to -, you'll never guess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.270" end="00:09.890">Very fucking scary, hard shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.890" end="00:11.390">I mean heavy fucking stuff</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.180" end="00:13.000">That goes rung-gun-gun-gun-g-gun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.000" end="00:14.830">Can't get enough!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.830" end="00:16.770">And I won't conform to the norm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.770" end="00:18.860">I was born poor, but not war-torn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.860" end="00:21.060">Now look, I'm really just a lover</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.060" end="00:24.610">So never judge a motherfucking book by its motherfucking cover</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.610" end="00:27.040">And if you don't know, well, here's the sitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.040" end="00:30.320">I'm just a smart ass, middle-class metalhead (bitch!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.320" end="00:33.280">Ah, I fucking love that shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.280" end="00:35.810">Ah, I fucking moved that pit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.810" end="00:37.750">Ah, I've got a demon to feed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.750" end="00:41.180">Some fucking pissed-off shit is fucking all that I need, fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.180" end="00:44.030" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ha-ha-ha, oh, yeah, I forgot to mention)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.030" end="00:46.590">I like to curse like I was raised in a barn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.590" end="00:48.950">Fuck, shit, piss, cock, titties, and darn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.950" end="00:51.960">I'm not just heartless, darkness, and an artless narcissist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.960" end="00:55.110">I harness charming smartness and a disarming sharpness, bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.110" end="00:57.280">I'm harmless, I wouldn't hurt a fly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.280" end="01:05.280">But you fuck with my friends, and you're gonna fucking (die, ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.380" end="01:08.800">And if you don't know, well, here's the sitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.800" end="01:12.210">I'm just your friendly neighborhood metalhead (bitch!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.210" end="01:15.000">Ah, I fucking love that shit (love that shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.000" end="01:17.720">Ah, I fucking moved that pit (moved that pit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.720" end="01:19.690">Ah, I've got a demon to feed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.690" end="01:23.260">Some fucking pissed-off shit is fucking all that I need (fuck)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.260" end="01:25.720">Ah, I'll fucking do it again (do it again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.720" end="01:28.730">Ah, I'm fucking pulling the pin (pulling the pin)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.730" end="01:30.550">Ah, that's what I'm all about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.550" end="01:33.900">And if you don't fucking like it, then get the fuck out!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.900" end="01:36.810" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh my God, how do you even understand what they're saying?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.810" end="01:44.240" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Shut up!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.240" end="01:52.240">Yo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.900" end="01:58.400">Heh-heh-heh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.040" end="02:01.720">Ah, I fucking love that shit (love that shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.720" end="02:05.470">Ah, I fucking move that pit (move that pit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.470" end="02:07.810">Ah, I've got a demon to feed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.810" end="02:13.030">Some fucking pissed-off shit is fucking all I need (fuck)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.030" end="02:16.020">I'll fucking do it again (do again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.020" end="02:19.440">Ah, I'm fucking pulling the pin (pulling the pin)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.440" end="02:22.310">Ah, I'm fucking scratching the itch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.310" end="02:26.040">I'll say it loud and fucking proud, I'm a metalhead (bitch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.040" end="02:30.040" /></div></body></tt>